{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824510/extras/17815ae24de3d4aaab9fc6a607a2e31f.avif?t=1765126618\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BODYCAM</strong> <strong>1997</strong></i> is a first-person shooter horror combined with\u00a0psychological and atmospheric elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Demo</i></strong> Version is currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and Yes!</strong> You can play this on your  old device as the game is taking in consideration every aspect of\u00a0<strong>Optimization</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check\u00a0<strong>Recommended Requirements </strong>for more information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824510/extras/9a7507e1844522d54378c2f53781b56c.avif?t=1765126618\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Key Features:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal Creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2-3 hours of Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Spaces</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a place where memories rot, machinery still breathes and escape is the only option.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one remembers the arrival clearly. Not even the protagonist. There was no descent.<br>No crash, nor a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just waking. A waking into something too abandoned, too raw and empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the unforeseen consequences... and well also</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sometimes you may be left wondering, who is the benefactor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by an independent one man studio from Croatia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i>Induction Studio</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824510?t=1765126618","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824510?t=1765126618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824510/a0941b3b938eb8d45aac5bbd52e448ae046ab302/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765126618","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824510/a0941b3b938eb8d45aac5bbd52e448ae046ab302/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765126618","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains horror themes such as: depictions of violence, blood and corpses."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824510/extras/17815ae24de3d4aaab9fc6a607a2e31f.avif?t=1765126618\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BODYCAM</strong> <strong>1997</strong></i> is a first-person shooter horror combined with\u00a0psychological and atmospheric elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Demo</i></strong> Version is currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and Yes!</strong> You can play this on your  old device as the game is taking in consideration every aspect of\u00a0<strong>Optimization</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check\u00a0<strong>Recommended Requ